; Fixed T736 board LPDDR4x: 8 GiB, geometry observed on source-v1/v2.
; Based on the Tina demo_aiot-bak 32-word seed; user requested fixed memory.
; tpr13 bit0 bypasses auto_scan_dram_config; para2 bit31 uses encoded MiB.
; Necessary PHY training remains enabled. See evidence/source-v3-fixed-lp4-review-20261114.json.
